usb-lcd-dashboard (0.6.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * First Ubuntu package. Ships the dashboard, a vendored smartscreen-driver,
    and the udev rule that creates /dev/turing-lcd.
  * Depends on the archive's python3-pil, python3-serial and python3-numpy
    rather than bundling a Python runtime as the Windows installer does.
  * usb-lcd-dashboard install now enables and starts the systemd user service
    instead of only writing the unit file, and uninstall stops it before
    removing the unit.

